<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - June 17.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - June 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1445 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat to Southampton, Tewkesbury, Avonmouth, Gloucester June 111.00, July 112.50</p>
<p>Feed Wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk June 83.00, July 84.50, October-December 92.00, Herefordshire, July 84.00, Avon range June 84.00</p>
<p>Feed Barley Norfolk/Suffolk June 80.50</p>
</text>
